# --- @fill: possessive pronouns — mäi/meng/däi/deng --------------------------
# Gender/number agreement: mäi(n) before masc/neut singular, meng before fem
# singular + plural. Same pattern for däi(n)/deng. Distractors are the wrong
# gender form of the same person.

@fill
@lu [Mäi] Papp ass grouss an dënn.
@en [My] father is tall and thin.
@distractor-lu Meng
@distractor-lu Däi
@distractor-lu Deng
@distractor-en Your
@distractor-en His
@distractor-en Her

@fill
@lu [Meng] Mamm huet kuerz Hoer.
@en [My] mother has short hair.
@distractor-lu Mäi
@distractor-lu Däi
@distractor-lu Deng
@distractor-en Your
@distractor-en His
@distractor-en Her

@fill
@lu Ass dat [deng] Schwëster?
@en Is that [your] sister?
@distractor-lu däi
@distractor-lu mäi
@distractor-lu meng
@distractor-en my
@distractor-en his
@distractor-en her

@fill
@lu [Däi] Brudder ass ganz sportlech.
@en [Your] brother is very sporty.
@distractor-lu Deng
@distractor-lu Mäi
@distractor-lu Meng
@distractor-en My
@distractor-en His
@distractor-en Her

